\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Sinners Jesus will receive:
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Tell this word of grace to all
\par Who the heavenly pathway leave,
\par All who linger, all who fall
\par This can bring them back again:
\par "Jesus welcomes sinful men".
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Shepherds seeks their wandering sheep
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Over mountains bleak and cold;
\par Jesus such a watch will keep
\par Over lost ones from his fold
\par Searching over moor and fen:
\par Jesus welcomes sinful men.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  I am sick and sad and blind,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 You alone can set me free;
\par O my saviour, you can find
\par Help for sinners such as me;
\par Speak that word of love again:
\par "Jesus welcomes sinful men".
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Jesus welcomes sinful men,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 Even me with all my sin;
\par Opens heaven to me again;
\par With him I may enter in.
\par Death has no more sting or pain:
\par \pard         Jesus welcomes sinful men.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

